# MEADOW HIVE — the structure at a mid-band critter spawn site. The small
# tameable creatures come from somewhere, and this is it: a blubbery comb on a
# strut frame, soft and quick to take apart compared with a kraken den.
#
# Deliberately the WEAKEST nest. A meadow is the early-game place: it should be
# possible to clear one with a sidearm and a little patience, before the ship
# has guns worth the name.
#
#   godot --headless --path . --script tools/ship_preview.gd -- ships/nest_hive.ship
#
#   W  blubber (the comb)   |  strut (the frame)   M  meat (the core)
#
# ONE connected piece — see the note in nest_roost.ship.

origin 3 2

.WWWW.
WWMMWW
WWMMWW
